    {
      "subId": "7306618",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Aranaga",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730661801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730661801": {
            "id": "730661801",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Aranaga",
            "text": "Over here, Jamikayomars is!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730661802"
            ]
          },
          "730661802": {
            "id": "730661802",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Aranaga",
            "text": "Nara Varuna's memory cup grows here, so the name is Jamikayomars. Jamikayomars is guarding Mawtiyima, so cannot enter, those bad guys.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730661803"
            ]
          },
          "730661803": {
            "id": "730661803",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But... Where, the Marana you spoke of is?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730661805",
              "730661807"
            ]
          },
          "730661805": {
            "id": "730661805",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Talking like this? Since when did you start...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730661808"
            ]
          },
          "730661808": {
            "id": "730661808",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Aranaga",
            "text": "Mawtiyima has been infiltrated by Marana. So we must infuse Arahaoma into Jamikayomars.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730661809"
            ]
          },
          "730661809": {
            "id": "730661809",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Aranaga",
            "text": "He will open the path for us, once Jamikayomars remembers it all, then we go in and rescue Mawtiyima.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730661810"
            ]
          },
          "730661810": {
            "id": "730661810",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What is it, Arahaoma?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730661811"
            ]
          },
          "730661811": {
            "id": "730661811",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Aranaga",
            "text": "The essence of memory, messenger that drives away death, the elixir Arahaoma is. Carries our memories, carries our life, the elixir Arahaoma.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730661812"
            ]
          },
          "730661812": {
            "id": "730661812",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Aranaga",
            "text": "To make Arahaoma, three types of plants are required: Yajna Grass and its friends, Barsam Flower and Zohrah Mushroom.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730661813"
            ]
          },
          "730661813": {
            "id": "730661813",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Aranaga",
            "text": "Under the moonlight, with the precious memories, refine them, so that the potion can be complete.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730661814"
            ]
          },
          "730661814": {
            "id": "730661814",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Aranaga",
            "text": "After Arahaoma is offered, Jamikayomars will awaken, then our memory will flow out, flow into the forest.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730661815"
            ]
          },
          "730661815": {
            "id": "730661815",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Aranaga",
            "text": "Mawtiyima, will be saved.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730661816"
            ]
          },
          "730661816": {
            "id": "730661816",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "About the memory...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730661817"
            ]
          },
          "730661817": {
            "id": "730661817",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Aranaga",
            "text": "Nara language, I don't know how to use. Memory, dead, frozen, many Nara believe. Memory will be lost, many Nara believe.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730661818"
            ]
          },
          "730661818": {
            "id": "730661818",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Aranaga",
            "text": "But it is alive, flowing, not lost... It needs to be nourished.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730661819"
            ]
          },
          "730661819": {
            "id": "730661819",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Aranaga",
            "text": "There are dreams because there is memory. Memory is nourished, so there is life.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730661820"
            ]
          },
          "730661820": {
            "id": "730661820",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Aranaga",
            "text": "So, it can grow, the thing to repel Marana.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730661821"
            ]
          },
          "730661821": {
            "id": "730661821",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Aranaga",
            "text": "Oh, what's that Nara word... I'm stuck. Don't know how to say it."
          },
          "730661807": {
            "id": "730661807",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey! That's none of your business!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
